o data. The data starts 2012. Let me check the max season. Let me run a quick check.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecb88469001RZdjQc1lg812OY","sessionID":"ses_1134b197affeltRDVI502UKukp","messageID":"msg_eecb8661c001DpuNeWRuqXoCKy"}}
