 the test also checks `normalizeTeamName(\"Boavista Sport Club (antigo Esporte Clube Barreira) - RJ\")` → expected \"Boavista Sport Club\". After antigo strip: \"Boavista Sport Club - RJ\". lower = \"boavista sport club - rj\". Not in map. Then strip `-RJ`: \"Boavista Sport Club\". Good.\n\nNow for \"Palmeiras-SP\": antigo strip no-op. lower = \"palmeiras-sp\". Not in canonical map (only \"palmeiras\"). Then strip `-SP`: \"Palmeiras\". Then map lookup... wait, the map lookup already happened. After stripping we just return s. So \"Palmeiras\". Good.\n\nBut there's a subtle issue: \"Palmeiras-SP\" → lower \"palmeiras-sp\" → not in map → strip → \"Palmeiras\". Returns \"Palmeiras\". \n\nNow the test expected `normalizeTeamName(\"Athletico-PR\") === \"Athletico-PR\"`. With the fix: lower = \"athletico-pr\", in map → returns \"Athletico-PR\". \n\nNow fix the tests for Flamengo roster (use Santos) and 2023 stats (use 2019 or 2022). Let me update the tests.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eecb976fc00147VrF8QQNmZ0er","sessionID":"ses_1134b197affeltRDVI502UKukp","messageID":"msg_eecb9415a001v3Rl6UODSxw6eW"}}
